{"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnormalizer\/normalize(_:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a copy of the provided document normalized to the most recent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"supported MusicXML version, along with an array describing each change"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applied."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNormalizer\/normalize(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNormalizer"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"normalize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"document","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument","text":"MXLDocument","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLDocumentV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLDocument","text":"MXLDocument","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLNormalizerV6ChangeO","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNormalizer\/Change","text":"Change","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"])","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The document to normalize.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"document"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[